<title>AUSTRIA: Wienerberger 96 net down, dividend steady.</title>
<headline>Wienerberger 96 net down, dividend steady.</headline>
<dateline>VIENNA 1997-04-22</dateline>
<text>
<p>Austrian brick maker Wienerberger Baustoffindustrie said on Tuesday 1996 final group net profit fell to 800 million schillings from 1.12 billion a year earlier.</p>
<p>In a statement, Wienerberger said it would leave its 1996 dividend unchanged at 42 schillings per share.</p>
